{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"636012145204527127","content":"Yes, Eastern Star and a bunch of affiliate organizations.  Masons, American Legion all the 'old clubs' are struggling a bit.  They relied on tradition and generation (your dad was in, so you will be in etc...) to continue.... Well that ain't working.  I joined so I could get involved in my father-in-laws care at the nursing home if I had to.  But I am not into all the ritual and such.  Its all allegorical play acting, cool.  But I think there are better ways now.","created_at":"2020-07-20T12:43:23.837000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734752318788075582","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
